    "detailed_description": "To commemorate Kou Shibusawa's 35th anniversary, the &quot;Kou Shibusawa Archives&quot; will be opened in the Steam Store. Here we will revive popular previously released titles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this seventh round of releases, we offer &quot;Romance of the Three Kingdoms \u2166 with Power Up Kit,&quot; an expanded version of the 7th game in the series. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith &quot;Enjoy the lives of all the Romance Warriors!&quot; as the theme, in this version players can play any of the officers that appear in the game. Experience a range of lifestyles through the lives of the officers; Ruler, Strategist, Governor, Officer, Free Officer, they're all available. Immerse yourself in your favorite Warrior and plunge into the chaos of the Three Kingdoms.",
